  "description": "Unofficial, strongly typed .NET 10 client for the TypeSafe System One API, ported from the official Python SDK. Choice, noul, score, and box questions; image assets; typed exceptions per status code; retry with jitter and Retry-After; per-call timeout, headers, and body; and a deterministic offline simulator for tests and CI.",
