  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Sync with Python SDK 0.7.5: BoxSchema and BoxAnswer for locating things in images; ImageAsset (bytes, file, base64, stream) uploaded as multipart, by alias, by placement, or via AttachAssets; zstd request compression on by default (TypeSafeOptions.Compression); NaN and Infinity sent as strings; noul questions may omit instructions when an outcome is described; invalid questions and null state rejected before the network.",
